# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Frontend configuration — Cloudflare Workers backend.
#
# The Worker's own secrets (SESSION_PEPPER, etc.) do NOT belong here.
# They live in cloudflare/worker/.dev.vars for local development and in
# `wrangler secret put` for production. See CLOUDFLARE-README.md § C.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Base URL of the deployed Worker API. The page reads this as
# window.CLOUDFLARE_API_URL before cloudflare-api.js loads; leave it unset
# and the app falls back to localStorage (offline single-file build).
CLOUDFLARE_API_URL=https://primarc-tendering-api.workers.dev/api
